<title>FINLAND: AKTIA BANK SAYS APPOINTS NEW BOARD.</title>
<headline>AKTIA BANK SAYS APPOINTS NEW BOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Aktia Bank said in a statement on Tuesday it had appointed a new board of directors.</p>
<p>&quot;The Aktia supervisory board has appointed Caj-Gunnar Lindstrom as a new member of the board,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>Patrick Enckell was re-elected as chairman of the board and Lasse Koivu as vice-chairman. Sven-Erik Kjellman and Elmer Orndahl were also re-elected to the board, the company said.</p>
<p>The board appointed Mikael Ingberg as manager and member of the executive group, Aktia said.</p>
<p>Due to the appointment Ingberg resings from the board, it added.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom + 358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
